<style>
@page { size: 11in 8.5in; margin: .35in; mso-page-orientation: landscape; }
body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; color:#1f1f1f; font-size:9pt; }
h1 { color:#1f4e78; font-size:22pt; border-bottom:3px solid #5b9bd5; }
h2 { color:#1f4e78; font-size:16pt; margin-top:0; }
.cover { page-break-after:always; }
.sheet { page-break-before:always; }
.sheet:first-of-type { page-break-before:auto; }
table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:auto; margin-bottom:12pt; }
th { background:#1f4e78; color:white; font-weight:bold; text-align:left; border:1px solid #9eafbf; padding:4px; vertical-align:top; }
td { border:1px solid #b8c2cc; padding:3px; vertical-align:top; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#edf3f8; }
.pass { background:#c6efce !important; color:#006100; font-weight:bold; }
.warning { background:#ffeb9c !important; color:#9c6500; font-weight:bold; }
.broken,.p0 { background:#ffc7ce !important; color:#9c0006; font-weight:bold; }
.unverified { background:#d9e1f2 !important; font-weight:bold; }
.p1 { background:#fce5cd !important; font-weight:bold; }
.p2 { background:#fff2cc !important; font-weight:bold; }
.p3 { background:#d9ead3 !important; font-weight:bold; }
.small { color:#666; font-size:8pt; }
.toc li { margin:4pt 0; }
</style></head><body>
<div class="cover"><h1>Crisis System Audit</h1><p><b>Complete repository-wide technical audit</b></p><p>This Word-compatible document contains the complete contents of the former spreadsheet in seven sections, with one table row per audited crisis, mission, objective type, legacy, critical issue, and AI mission.</p><p class="small">Generated from the audited workbook. This is HTML stored with a .doc extension so it remains reviewable as text in source control and opens in Microsoft Word.</p><h2>Contents</h2><ol class="toc">
<li><a href="#sheet1">1. Executive Summary</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet2">2. Crisis Audit</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet3">3. Mission Audit</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet4">4. Objective Type Audit</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet5">5. Legacy Audit</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet6">6. Critical Issues</a></li>
<li><a href="#sheet7">7. AI Audit</a></li>
</ol></div>
