<tr>
<td class="p1">P1</td>
<td>All</td>
<td>AI mission execution</td>
<td>AI scores/selects missions but only intentionally executes alien negotiation and mutant integration; asteroid production is separate.</td>
<td>ExecuteAiCrisisAction handles only NegotiateCrisisSettlement and IntegrateCrisisUnits.</td>
<td>AI takes oaths it cannot deliberately pursue.</td>
<td>Add per-objective AI plans or exclude infeasible missions.</td>
<td>CrisisManager.cs:1095-1140</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="p2">P2</td>
<td>All</td>
<td>Auto-trigger/history</td>
<td>CanAutoTrigger rejects any crisis in crisisHistory before repeat-mode logic can matter.</td>
<td>CanAutoTrigger checks crisisHistory directly; TriggerCrisis separately has occurrence/cooldown logic.</td>
<td>Repeatable crises appear unable to auto-trigger again.</td>
<td>Use CanTriggerByHistory consistently in CanAutoTrigger.</td>
<td>CrisisManager.cs:905-925</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="p2">P2</td>
<td>All</td>
<td>Mission sequencing</td>
<td>Only the current objective receives event progress; actions done before a later sequential objective are discarded.</td>
<td>AddProgress -&gt; TryAdvance compares only state.CurrentObjective.</td>
<td>Players/AI can unknowingly perform required action too early and get no credit.</td>
<td>Document sequencing or persist eligible counters per objective.</td>
<td>CrisisManager.cs:597-616, 2203-2222</td>
</tr>
</table></section>
